OL,13,     FCarlingford to Dublin: Michael
OL,14,     FPortillo makes his way from the
OL,15,     Fvast beaches of the Carlingford
OL,16,     FPeninsula to the capital of the
OL,17,     FRepublic of Ireland, Dublin.
